    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3330" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόντ-ισμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>distance thrown with javelin</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντὸς ἀκοντίσματος</span> within <i>dart's throw</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.4.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dart, javelin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				4.6.7
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				9.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in pl.,
				= the concrete <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκοντισταί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				21
			</span></i>.</div>
